This was a very tricky list to compile, as I have 2 ranges of number that I 
needed to compile into 1 number to rate the items fairly.  I'm including here
the damage done by the weapons, complete with an average damage. (That being
defined as the average between the average large damage and the average small
damage.)  Average damage is the number I used to rate weaponry, and it did not
take into advantage pluses to hit/damage (of course) or intrinsic bonuses/
minuses to hit (which are rare, but listed).  Thrown weapons are marked with
an "*", weapons that reaquire something (bow) to use them (arrow) are marked
with a "+".  Weapons that can be used either as a wielded weapon or thrown
are marked with an "&".

